  "formalDefinition": {
    "text": "只让一个输入动",
    "latex": "f_x(a,b)=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(a+h,b)-f(a,b)}h,\\quad f_{xy}=\\frac\\partial{\\partial y}(f_x)",
