      "latex": "g\\prime(a)=f_x(a,b)"
    },
    {
      "text": "再对偏导函数求偏导。",
      "latex": "f_{xy}=\\frac\\partial{\\partial y}\\left(\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\right)"
    }
